---
title:    "CurryDoc: A Documentation Tool for Declarative Programs"
citation: "(WFLP 2002)"
url:      "http://www.informatik.uni-kiel.de/~mh/papers/WFLP02_Doc.html"
date:     2002-01-01 # used for sorting, most recent first, should usually match the papers date
